{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > What's this game\uff1f</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698250/extras/ee201c0e9f1c8a9ce51f323f65efb478.poster.avif?t=1730708038\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698250/extras/ee201c0e9f1c8a9ce51f323f65efb478.webm?t=1730708038\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698250/extras/ee201c0e9f1c8a9ce51f323f65efb478.mp4?t=1730708038\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>&quot;CyberDog&quot; is an exhilarating casual multiplayer battle game that lets you unleash your combat passion in the arena! The core gameplay revolves around players skating around the arena, disrupting opponents, and picking up power-ups in intense showdowns.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Discord Server </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698250/extras/4c6af5c08a5f9e8f6eae2b4cf7a4c47f.avif?t=1730708038\" width=318 height=158 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > QQ Group </h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698250/extras/49d0bce53a89635c3f163faaf89dae43.avif?t=1730708038\" width=308 height=350 /></span><br>637516728<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > What can i expect\uff1f</h2>In the game, you'll control your character's movement in diverse arenas, using skating skills to dodge enemy attacks and cleverly utilize obstacles to protect yourself. You can collect various fun items, then use them to target opponents and engage in fierce battles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > How to win\uff1f</h2>The objective is straightforward: defeat all opponents and become the ultimate victor! Each time you hit an opponent, they get eliminated, but beware, as you could become someone else's target. &quot;CyberDog&quot; blends strategy, reflexes, and skills, offering an unparalleled adrenaline rush. Whether you're playing with friends or competing online, this game promises endless entertainment and challenges. Show off your skills and become the champion of arena skating battles!!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u8fde\u80dc\u6311\u6218Winning Streak Challenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698250/b276c1d5ddf9a37f7ab774602cf305ebb7ab734b.jpg"},{"name":"FIRSTBLOOD","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698250/fc3d3d890e12ad03848712fef8e234eb5cc5bb1b.jpg"},{"name":"TUTORIAL ACER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2698250/a12df55080afde5057cf461261c8010edc7b7a1e.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2698250?t=1730708038","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2698250?t=1730708038","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698250/f76617eccfaeea294733f2c4d9b853eed5f32f24/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1730708038","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698250/f76617eccfaeea294733f2c4d9b853eed5f32f24/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1730708038","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > What's this game\uff1f</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698250/extras/ee201c0e9f1c8a9ce51f323f65efb478.poster.avif?t=1730708038\" width=640 height=360 ><source